    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885530/extras/31870782bb3e6ef7904664989fe077e0.avif?t=1745968358\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>&lt;A side-scrolling beat-'em-up where you brawl alongside your trusty felines!&gt;</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Yachiyo, our fearless heroine, and team up with a gang of tough-as-claws cats to beat the nasty humans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch &amp; Kick</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can grab enemies to perform actions like headbutting them or tossing them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885530/extras/b05a95c8da3ee913ee7c7b1c649d6f71.avif?t=1745968358\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>&lt;Unleash your feline friends and trigger a powerful special move!&gt;</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your feline allies pounce on a bad guy, it\u2019s your cue to strike with a special move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the Cat Button and let the ultimate attack rip!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885530/extras/86e21478e43c57484f1d198ba3b9488b.avif?t=1745968358\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>&lt;Go for an even flashier super move!&gt;</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use special attacks in succession to charge up an ultra-powerful finisher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>&lt;Story&gt;</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where unique beasts like a talking cat, a dog that can do math, and an alpaca skilled in traditional carpentry once lived peacefully among humans...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, they were abducted by nasty humans who sought to keep them as &quot;pets.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Yachiyo, a girl on her way to school\u2014until she hears the desperate cries of the captured beasts. Without hesitation, she sets off to rescue them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Yachiyo save the beasts and restore harmony between humans and beasts?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885530/extras/31870782bb3e6ef7904664989fe077e0.avif?t=1745968358\" width=616 height=70 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>&lt;A side-scrolling beat-'em-up where you brawl alongside your trusty felines!&gt;</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as Yachiyo, our fearless heroine, and team up with a gang of tough-as-claws cats to beat the nasty humans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controls</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch &amp; Kick</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Map</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can grab enemies to perform actions like headbutting them or tossing them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885530/extras/b05a95c8da3ee913ee7c7b1c649d6f71.avif?t=1745968358\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>&lt;Unleash your feline friends and trigger a powerful special move!&gt;</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When your feline allies pounce on a bad guy, it\u2019s your cue to strike with a special move!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the Cat Button and let the ultimate attack rip!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2885530/extras/86e21478e43c57484f1d198ba3b9488b.avif?t=1745968358\" width=616 height=64 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>&lt;Go for an even flashier super move!&gt;</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use special attacks in succession to charge up an ultra-powerful finisher!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>&lt;Story&gt;</u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where unique beasts like a talking cat, a dog that can do math, and an alpaca skilled in traditional carpentry once lived peacefully among humans...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, they were abducted by nasty humans who sought to keep them as &quot;pets.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter Yachiyo, a girl on her way to school\u2014until she hears the desperate cries of the captured beasts. Without hesitation, she sets off to rescue them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Yachiyo save the beasts and restore harmony between humans and beasts?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Team up with felines and unleash justice on the nasty humans! A exciting side-scrolling beat-'em-up! Make peace with the cats, or prepare to be pounced.",
